  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d5230ad7-a847-5291-8f45-ae0ab72818fc" activityNameId="79002b71-86c7-557d-8fed-9249f95239ff" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at reservoir power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at reservoir power plant
The dataset consists of figures of the Itaipu hydropower station complemented with European data. Considered are the area used, the amount of turbined water and the greenhouse gas emissions. The lifetime is assumed to be 150 years for the dams and 80 years for the other material. The data describe a mix and can therefore not be used  for an individual storage hydropower station. This dataset is recalculated based on Itaipu Binacional, Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Diem et al. (2008).;
UUID: e0a1e90a-da44-3f54-9187-3bdf139975d7
Operation of an average storage hydropower station in Brazil. It includes the area transformed and occupied, the volume of the reservoir, greenhouse gas emissions, the consumption of lubricant oil and the amount of turbined water.
Location: Average Brazilian electricity production in storage hydropower station
Technology: Average installed technology. Efficiency 0.78. Annual production volume: 190GWh/a.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e0a1e90a-da44-3f54-9187-3bdf139975d7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="af2fe869-d899-51ee-a481-925418bd269e" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
